ed.png/revision/latest?cb=20230811164812\" class=\"image image-thumbnail\" title=\"Forged\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<img src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/5/5c/Electrified_Rock_Forged.png/revision/latest?cb=20230811164812\" srcset=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/5/5c/Electrified_Rock_Forged.png/revision/latest?cb=20230811164812 1x, https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/5/5c/Electrified_Rock_Forged.png/revision/latest?cb=20230811164812 2x\" data-relevant=\"1\" class=\"pi-image-thumbnail\" alt=\"Forged\" width=\"248\" height=\"202\" data-image-key=\"Electrified Rock Forged.png\" data-image-name=\"Electrified Rock Forged.png\" />\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t</a>\n\t\t\t\t</figure>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t</div>\n\n\n\n\t<section class=\"pi-item pi-panel pi-border-color wds-tabber\">\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tabs__wrapper\">\n\t\t\t\t<ul class=\"wds-tabs\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<li class=\"wds-tabs__tab wds-is-current\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tabs__tab-label\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tStats\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</li>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<li class=\"wds-tabs__tab\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tabs__tab-label\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tInfo\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</li>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t</ul>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tab__content wds-is-current\">\n\t\t\t\t<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t<table class=\"pi-horizontal-group\">\n\t<caption class=\"pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-secondary-background pi-item-spacing\">Volume Cost</caption>\n\t\n\t<thead>\n\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<th class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-label pi-secondary-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"Stone\">Stone</th>\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<th class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-label pi-secondary-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"Refined\">Refined</th>\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<th class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-label pi-secondary-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"Forged\">Forged</th>\n\t\t\n\t\t</tr>\n\t</thead>\n\t\n\t<tbody>\n\t<tr>\n\t\n\t\t<td class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-value pi-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"Stone\">$25/stud</td>\n\t\n\t\t<td class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-value pi-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"Refined\">$30/stud</td>\n\t\n\t\t<td class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-value pi-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"Forged\">$35/stud</td>\n\t\n\t</tr>\n\t</tbody>\n</table>\n\n</section>\n\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tab__content\">\n\t\t\t\t<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"Version Added\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Version Added</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">v1.36.0</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Date Added</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">August 11th, 2023</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"Status\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Status</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Obtainable</div>\n</div>\n\n</section>\n\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t</section>\n\n\n\n</aside>\n\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\"></p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Description\">Description</span></h2>\n<p><b>Electrified Stone</b>, like <b><a href=\"/wiki/Electrified_Tree\" title=\"Electrified Tree\">Electrified Trees</a></b>, can be obtained if a <b>lightning bolt</b> strikes a <b><a href=\"/wiki/Category:Ores\" title=\"Category:Ores\">stone vein</a></b>.\n</p><p>This stone type emits miniature lightning particles, similarly to <b><a href=\"/wiki/Electrified_Tree\" title=\"Electrified Tree\">Electrified Trees</a></b>.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Trivia\">Trivia</span></h2>\n<ul><li>Before a patch on an unknown date, when mined, instead of being titled \"<b>Electrified Rock</b>\", it had the title \"<b>electrified_rock</b>\".<figure class=\"thumb  show-info-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File/Thumb\" style=\"width: 131px\"> \t<a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/d/d3/Image_2024-07-08_215320396.png/revision/latest?cb=20240708115354\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"Example of an Electrified Rock vein in the shape of a tree, discovered by NovaKane in July of 2024.\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"131\" height=\"177\" class=\"thumbimage lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Image 2024-07-08 215320396.png\" data-image-key=\"Image_2024-07-08_215320396.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/d/d3/Image_2024-07-08_215320396.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/131?cb=20240708115354\" /></a> \t<noscript><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/d/d3/Image_2024-07-08_215320396.png/revision/latest?cb=20240708115354\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"Example of an Electrified Rock vein in the shape of a tree, discovered by NovaKane in July of 2024.\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/d/d3/Image_2024-07-08_215320396.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/131?cb=20240708115354\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"131\" height=\"177\" class=\"thumbimage\" data-image-name=\"Image 2024-07-08 215320396.png\" data-image-key=\"Image_2024-07-08_215320396.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/d/d3/Image_2024-07-08_215320396.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/131?cb=20240708115354\" /></a></noscript> \t<figcaption class=\"thumbcaption\"> \t\t \t\t\t<a href=\"/wiki/File:Image_2024-07-08_215320396.png\" class=\"info-icon\"><svg><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-info-small\"></use></svg></a> \t\t \t\t \t\t \t\t\t<p class=\"caption\">Electrified Rock Tree</p> \t\t \t</figcaption> </figure></li>\n<li>Despite the odds of lightning striking a stone being <b>drastically</b> rarer due to the scarcity of rocks compared to trees, they are valued <b>much</b> less than <b><a href=\"/wiki/Electrified_Tree\" title=\"Electrified Tree\">Electrified Trees</a>.</b></li>\n<li>Players, especially beginners, could easily get the <b>Forged</b> version of <b>Electrified Stone</b> confused with the <b>Forged</b> version of <b><a href=\"/wiki/Sand\" title=\"Sand\">Sand</a></b>.</li>\n<li>In update 1.60.0, new rock generation was added, one such being the Stone Tree where the rock formation forms into a tree. There has only been one notable recording of such, and is an <b>Electrified Rock</b> tree.</li></ul>\n<figure class=\"thumb  show-info-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File/Thumb\" style=\"width: 180px\"> \t<a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/a/a8/Electrified_Rock_in_the_mine%3F%3F%3F.png/revision/latest?cb=20240913192837\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"Electrified Rock in the mine?\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"180\" height=\"187\" class=\"thumbimage lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Electrified Rock in the mine???.png\" data-image-key=\"Electrified_Rock_in_the_mine%3F%3F%3F.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/a/a8/Electrified_Rock_in_the_mine%3F%3F%3F.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/180?cb=20240913192837\" /></a> \t<noscript><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/a/a8/Electrified_Rock_in_the_mine%3F%3F%3F.png/revision/latest?cb=20240913192837\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"Electrified Rock in the mine?\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/a/a8/Electrified_Rock_in_the_mine%3F%3F%3F.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/180?cb=20240913192837\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"180\" height=\"187\" class=\"thumbimage\" data-image-name=\"Electrified Rock in the mine???.png\" data-image-key=\"Electrified_Rock_in_the_mine%3F%3F%3F.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/a/a8/Electrified_Rock_in_the_mine%3F%3F%3F.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/180?cb=20240913192837\" /></a></noscript> \t<figcaption class=\"thumbcaption\"> \t\t \t\t\t<a href=\"/wiki/File:Electrified_Rock_in_the_mine%3F%3F%3F.png\" class=\"info-icon\"><svg><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-info-small\"></use></svg></a> \t\t \t\t \t\t \t\t\t<p class=\"caption\">Electrified Rock in the mine?</p> \t\t \t</figcaption> </figure>\n<table class=\"navbox mw-collapsible\" style=\"background:#291F1D; width:100%; padding:.1em; margin:.5em auto; -webkit-border-radius:5px; -moz-border-radius:0 10px 10px 0\" data-expandtext=\"Open\" data-collapsetext=\"Close\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<th style=\"width:105px; background:#140401; -webkit-border-radius:5px; -moz-border-radius:0 10px 10px 0\"><span style=\"float:left; padding-left:10px; padding-top:4px; font-size:90%\"><a href=\"/wiki/Template:Stone_Nav\" title=\"Template:Stone Nav\"><span title=\"View this template\">v</span></a> • <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" class=\"text\" href=\"https://oaklands.fandom.com/wiki/Template_talk:Stone_Nav\"><span title=\"Discuss this template\">d</span></a> • <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" class=\"text\" href=\"https://oaklands.fandom.com/wiki/Template:Stone_Nav?action=edit\"><span title=\"Edit this template\">e</span></a></span><figure class=\"mw-halign-center\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Oaklands\" title=\"Oaklands Wiki\"><img alt=\"Oaklands Wiki\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width